<title>SPAIN: FCC,Dragados,Cubiertas win Madrid airport contract.</title>
<headline>FCC,Dragados,Cubiertas win Madrid airport contract.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-12-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spanish airport manager Aena said on Monday it had awarded a 29 billion peseta contract to build a third runway at Madrid's Barajas airport to Spanish construction firms FCC, Cubiertas and Dragados.</p>
</text>
